Eu sei. Sinto o mesmo.

976
01:33:27,853 --> 01:33:30,314
Sim, parece bom.

977
01:33:31,607 --> 01:33:35,277
Certo, legal.

978
01:33:58,300 --> 01:34:00,261
-Oi.
-Oi.

979
